    "acceptance": "Evaluate temporal false negatives/false positives, ambiguous decisions, permissions, exact full-rule IR and authored regressions separately; no default promotion unless the declared96/96 legacy gate and independent fresh development criteria pass.",
    "candidate": "Frozen span-token encoder plus a new temporal-only attention query and binary classifier over concatenated global mean and attention-pooled token features.",
    "common_parent": "Immutable N4 split-feature checkpoint95bd50a7\u2026 / frozen34-statefb63e61c\u2026; each cell starts independently from the same parent.",
    "control": "Current frozen-feature mean-pool binary temporal head with CE; original34 frozen, two trainable tensors, rows0:6 inactive.",
    "data": "Only authenticated training labels enter optimization. Expand training coverage with adjudicated modality-paired dates/durations across varying noun-phrase length, clauses, positions and genuine temporal negatives; exclude exposed diagnostic sources and their target-bearing reference containers from training.",
    "formula": "z=softmax(q^T*h_i/sqrt(hidden_dim)) weighted sum of valid source-token h_i; temporal logits=W*[mean(h),z]+b. No supplied gold span, ID feature, target injection or ID-specific branch at inference.",
    "initialization": "q=0; classifier global-mean block copies parent temporal rows, attention block=0, bias copies parent. Assert exact392-source full-head equality before training rather than assume algebra implies binary32 parity.",
    "invariants": "No external/latent encoders; original34 gradientsNone and value digests fixed; true three-tensor optimizer subset; exact initial parent parity and final all392 protected-head vectors; immutable outputs and finite resource evidence.",
    "limits": "Learned token attention is source-grounded but not a semantic proof. Real US Code references, family-specific typed AST/renderers, lake build legal, and genuine8D/384D/768D conditioning remain separate qualification work.",
    "matched_budget": "Preregister batch ordering, source occurrences, optimizer updates, seed and wall/RSS/storage envelope; report extra token-attention work explicitly instead of claiming equal compute.",
    "objective": "Same temporal CE; no new margin or inference threshold tuning in this first feature comparison. Fixed native decision/tie/abstention rules.",
    "parameter_budget": "Declare exact names/shapes before implementation: frozen original34 plus temporal query/classifier weight/classifier bias (three trainable tensors). Report scalar counts and changed compute; the control has two trainable tensors.",
    "purpose": "Test whether learnable source-token pooling improves temporal evidence extraction while protecting all other heads; distinguish this from selecting a threshold for an exposed error.",
    "split_and_selection": "Freeze new source/template/title-aware development/test partitions and reference adjudication before training or selection. Prior392 references stay explicitly exposed engineering diagnostics. Use fresh development for any calibration; never the known remaining row or test targets."
